      "text": "METROBASE Traffic Update as of 7:00pm\n\nWHEN: March 21, 2026\n\nA. MAJOR ROADS:\n\n*EDSA\nSOUTHBOUND \n- Monte De Piedad to Connecticut, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ortigas to Shaw blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Shaw blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Magallanes to MOA, slow moving (due to Pyro Musical Competition)\n\nNORTHBOUND\n- Roxas Blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Park Ave. to Taft Ave., moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ayala to Buendia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Shaw blvd to Ortigas, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Santolan to Aurora blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Balintawak, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*C5\nSOUTHBOUND\n- Xavierville Ave. to Aurora blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Eastwood to Green Meadows, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Julia Vargas to Lanuza, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Lanuza, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Green Meadows, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Blueridge, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ateneo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*COMMONWEALTH\nEASTBOUND:\n- light traffic\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Atherton, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*QUEZON AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Delta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Sct.Borromeo to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Sen.Miriam Defensor Santiago Ave. to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Delta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Araneta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*MARCOS HIGHWAY\nEASTBOUND:\n- F.Mariano to Felix Ave., moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- light traffic\n\n*ORTIGAS AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Wilson, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Meralco Ave., moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND\n- Corithians to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Greenhills, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Madison to Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ROXAS BOULEVARD\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Katigbak Prkwy, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Quirino Ave. to P.Ocampo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Bradco Ave. to Airport road, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Luneta to Padre. Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*TAFT AVENUE\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Quirino Ave., moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- P.Ocampo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Buendia Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Arnaiz Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Arnaiz Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P.Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Quirino Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n#mmda",
